  "short_description": "<p data-path-to-node=\"0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Handcrafted Natural Rattan Ball Coffee Table</b></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"1\">\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_461ff8bee958e254-23\" data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sustainable &amp; Eco-Friendly:</b> Made from 100% natural, biodegradable rattan</span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0,2\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_461ff8bee958e254-24\" data-path-to-node=\"1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Artisanal Craftsmanship:</b> Hand-coiled by traditional Vietnamese artisans, blending organic aesthetics with durable structure</span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,1,0,2\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_461ff8bee958e254-25\" data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Flexible OEM/ODM Customization:</b> Fully customizable in dimensions, colors/finishes, and packaging for B2B buyers</span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0,2\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_461ff8bee958e254-26\" data-path-to-node=\"1,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Meaningful Social Impact:</b> Supports rural farming communities with off-season income and preserves traditional weaving culture</span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,3,0,2\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
  "description": "<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Product Description</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">Introduce timeless natural warmth, organic design, and sustainable craftsmanship to your furniture lineup with our signature <b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"125\">Handcrafted Natural Rattan Ball Coffee Table</b>.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">Coiled meticulously from 100% natural rattan, this spherical accent table seamlessly serves as a central coffee table, side table, or statement ottoman. Designed specifically to meet the rigorous quality standards of international B2B buyers, this piece combines modern bohemian and eco-minimalist aesthetics with exceptional structural stability.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1449\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-1449\" style=\"width: 1600px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1449\" src=\"https://vietcraft.vn/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/VH2609-Natural-rattan-furniture.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1163\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-1449\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Natural Rattan furniture made in Vietnam</figcaption></figure>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"17\"><b data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Key Points</b></h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">100% Eco-Friendly &amp; Sustainable Material:</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1\">Made entirely from sustainably harvested natural rattan. It is lightweight, biodegradable, and non-toxic, aligning perfectly with the global surge in consumer demand for sustainable and green interior decor.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Masterful Handcraftsmanship:</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,1\">Each table is individually hand-coiled and assembled by skilled artisans. The unique concentric circle pattern provides a striking architectural structure while maintaining durability for long-term commercial or residential use.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Full OEM / ODM &amp; Customization Flexibility:</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,1\">We offer comprehensive customization options to help you tailor products to your local market needs:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18,2,2\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,2,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dimensions:</b> Custom diameter and height according to your specifications.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,2,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,2,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Colors &amp; Finishes:</b> Natural raw rattan, honey brown, antique dark stain, matte black, or whitewash.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,2,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,2,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Branding &amp; Packaging:</b> Private labeling, custom master cartons, and drop-shipping compliant packaging.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Our Core Values</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21\">When you partner with us, you purchase more than just premium furniture—you invest in a sustainable community movement:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"22\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rural Economic Empowerment:</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,0,1\">Our production model creates stable, supplementary employment for agricultural workers during off-season months when farming work is lean, providing vital extra income for rural families.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Preserving Cultural Heritage:</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,1,1\">By bringing these products to the international market, we actively support local artisan villages, helping to preserve century-old traditional hand-weaving techniques for future generations.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"24\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4. Technical Specifications</b></h3>\n<table data-path-to-node=\"25\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Feature</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Details</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,1,1,0\">100% Premium Natural Rattan / Cane</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Size</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,2,1,0\">Diameter: 60 cm | Height: 45 cm <i data-path-to-node=\"25,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"32\">(Customizable)</i></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Structure</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,3,1,0\">Reinforced internal rattan frame for high load capacity</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Finish</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,4,1,0\">Eco-friendly protective topcoat (Water-resistant &amp; Mold-resistant treatment)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Applications</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,5,1,0\">Living rooms, boutique hotels, resort lounges, covered patios, cafes</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,6,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Port of Loading</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,6,1,0\">Hai Phong Port, Vietnam</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"27\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">5. Why Partner With Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd?</b></h3>\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"28\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Direct Factory Pricing:</b> Maximize your profit margins with competitive factory-direct wholesale pricing.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Scalable Production Capacity:</b> Consistent quality control and volume delivery for full container loads (FCL).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Global Export Standards:</b> Complete experience in international shipping logistics, fumigation certification, and compliance standards.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"30\"><b data-path-to-node=\"30\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Call to Action</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31\"><b data-path-to-node=\"31\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Elevate your furniture collection today.</b> Contact our sales team to request a complete product catalog, request samples, or discuss custom OEM/ODM specifications.</p>",
